# Olduum's Leypoint talk against Navigating the Unfriendly Seas' (C#), the Leypoint's other talk line: a level 75
# Warrior in Wajaom Woodlands with a Lightning Band, Olduum completed, Navigating accepted at Prog 2 with Wait an hour
# ahead (GMs). Olduum's LEYPOINT + 1 (the band) and Navigating's ENIGMATIC_LIGHT (the Hydrogauge) are both messages:
# equal ranks play the first container first (Navigating's: the order line), then rotate; a higher kind on either would
# win every talk. Navigating's Wait past (a GM): its 508 (a Progress) beats Olduum's message; finished: Navigating Prog
# 3, Wait 0; the Leypoint: Olduum's message alone.
lists WajaomWoodlands/Leypoint/onTrigger WajaomWoodlands/onEventFinish/508
char zone=WajaomWoodlands pos=-198.5,-8.5,80.058 job=WAR lvl=75
item LightningBand
quest AhtUrhgan.Olduum completed
quest AhtUrhgan.NavigatingTheUnfriendlySeas accepted
charvar Quest[6][25]Prog 2
charvar Quest[6][25]Wait 1800003600
login
trigger Leypoint                        # the messages tie: Navigating's ENIGMATIC_LIGHT
finish-if-event
trigger Leypoint                        # Olduum's LEYPOINT + 1
finish-if-event
trigger Leypoint                        # ENIGMATIC_LIGHT again
finish-if-event
charvar Quest[6][25]Wait 0              # a GM
trigger Leypoint                        # Navigating, Wait past: 508 (a Progress) over Olduum's message
finish                                  # Navigating: Prog 3, Wait 0
trigger Leypoint                        # Navigating at Prog 3: nil; Olduum's LEYPOINT + 1
finish-if-event
